  "early_life": {
    "en": "Pascal was born in 1623 in Clermont-Ferrand, France. A child prodigy, he was educated by his father, a mathematician, and by the age of sixteen had written a significant treatise on conic sections that impressed leading mathematicians.",
    "es": "",
    "pt": "",
    "fr": "",
